  "notes": "Discovery Box pairs native ETH with a fixed-supply openable BOX token. Opening whole BOX units irreversibly advances maturity; buys use a 0.30% LP fee and the sell LP fee declines from 1.00% to 0.30% over 40 openings. The hook accrues the immutable 0.10% Programmable fee on executed gross native-ETH quote volume in all four swap quadrants with carried rounding and owner-only ERC-6909-backed claims. Both return-delta permissions perform real fee accounting; specified-ETH partial fills revert atomically. The project takes no hook-owned fee. This request seeks review only and claims no deployment, routing support, audit, approval, or availability."
